graph TB
    A[前端输入框] -->|上传本地图| UP[POST /resources/upload]
    A -->|选历史图| HR[从 image 消息取 resourceId]
    UP --> RID[得到 referenceResourceId]
    HR --> RID
    A -->|描述词 + referenceResourceId| MSG[POST /messages/stream]

    MSG --> B{是否 /image 命令?}
    B -->|是| IMG[图生图流程]
    B -->|否| C{是否带 referenceResourceId?}
    C -->|否| LLM[正常 LLM 聊天]
    C -->|是| INT[LLM 意图判断]
    INT -->|IMAGE_GENERATION| IMG
    INT -->|CHAT| LLM

    IMG --> READ[ResourceStorage.open 读图字节]
    READ --> B64[转 Base64 Data URL]
    B64 --> API[MiniMax subject_reference]
    API --> STORE[存生成图 + emit image event]
